Noctalia lock-screen on-screen keyboard.
Upstream PR: https://github.com/noctalia-dev/noctalia/pull/5233
Pinned head: whymusticode/noctalia@cff0dd078972a4ef35abd4c79f18da7000c5431b (MIT)
Audited for LegionForge on 2026-11-20 (LFORGE-18): no logging, exec, network or file IO;
key presses go through the lock surface's existing key path only while locked.
Drop this patch once Fedora's noctalia package includes the feature (the build
detects that and skips it).

